//
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// WORKFLOW WHEN DUPLICATES APPEAR ACROSS RUNS
//
//   1. Delete the .SchLib from disk.
//   2. Run ListOpenDocuments. If a SCHLIB entry still points at the file you
//      just deleted, that cached document is your duplicate source.
//   3. Copy that path into STALE_LIB_PATH, run CloseStaleLibrary.
//   4. Create the new library, make it active, run GenerateSymbol.
//
// GenerateSymbol also reports how many pre-existing copies it stripped. A
// non-zero count on a library you just created from scratch is proof Altium
// handed you a cached document.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

